{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47311","headline":"步虚词十首 十 · 吴筠","name":"步虚词十首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二气播万有，化机无停轮。\n而我操其端，乃能出陶钧。\n寥寥大漠上，所遇皆清真。\n澄莹含元和，气同自相亲。\n绦树结丹实，紫霞流碧津。\n以兹保童婴，永用超形神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}